@host = http://localhost:5080

### Happy path: EUR long, JPY long, GBP short
POST {{host}}/hedges/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseCurrency": "USD",
  "exposures": [
    { "currency": "EUR", "exposure": 1000000.00, "hedgeRatio": 0.75 },
    { "currency": "JPY", "exposure": 123457, "hedgeRatio": 0.5 },
    { "currency": "GBP", "exposure": -250000.00, "hedgeRatio": 1 }
  ]
}

### Validation error: ratio above 1 and duplicate currency
POST {{host}}/hedges/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseCurrency": "USD",
  "exposures": [
    { "currency": "EUR", "exposure": 100, "hedgeRatio": 1.5 },
    { "currency": "eur", "exposure": 100, "hedgeRatio": 0.5 }
  ]
}
